            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>toDo</code> değişkenine <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> değerini içeren bir dizi ata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Feed Clawdius&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;To Do:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(toDo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Feed Darian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"To Do:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[&quot;Feed Clawdius&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
